<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Micor lifts full yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Micor lifts full yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30 1996.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	37.6	vs    26.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  15.0	vs    10.0</p>
<p>    Attrib profit	   10.06	vs    6.38</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   14.09	vs    8.49</p>
<p>    Tax			  4.01	vs    2.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		 856.08	vs  826.71</p>
<p>Div payable around October 18</p>
<p>on register September 27</p>
<p>Full name: Micor Industrial Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - While future results would be influenced by the performance of the economy as a whole, the group said its liquidity placed it in a strong position to further expand its business activities.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
